</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>z</mi></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">⟩</mo></mrow><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.623em\" maxsize=\"1.623em\">|</mo></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">⟨</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">⟩</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">⟨</mo></mrow><munder><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\"><munder><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo>⏟</mo></munder></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>P</mi></mrow></munder><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><munder><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\"><munder><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo>⏟</mo></munder></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>Q</mi></mrow></munder><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><munder><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\"><munder><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>⏟</mo></munder></mrow><mi>R</mi></munder><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">⟩</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, we can evaluate our surface integral as follows:</p>\n<p><mjx-contai